From 733a68c25b7b438df805e50794cb0eef320af0ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 11:07:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(allwinner): retain A133 PSCI warm entry

Capture TF-A's trusted BL31 warm entry behind a default-off A133 bridge.
Expose checked suspend transaction steps without installing PSCI callbacks
or advertising SYSTEM_SUSPEND.

Validate BL31 ownership, preserve rollback and fail-stop ordering, and add
host coverage plus strict build dependencies.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
